            "review_title": "Review at Vejo - The Vege Journey",
            "review_text": "Vũ Linh\n1 contribution\n0\nThe most cozy vegetarian restaurant in Hanoi\nMar 2024 • Solo\nAlthough it is not the starting point for my vegetarian diet as the name of the restaurant suggests. However, it is the place that makes me eat vegetarian more often. Diverse and rich menu, friendly atmosphere. Creativity in decoration and expression. The warm affection that the staff gives me is something I rarely receive at other bustling restaurants. While a truly high-class luxury atmosphere is beyond my reach. The friends at Karma have brought me a truly warm, family-like feeling at every meal here.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten May 12, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
